  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "A maintenance scenario lists reference activities and how often each is done: so many times a year, by a pattern, or by usage such as distance or hours. Its rule book says which serialized items or installation groups it applies to. Generating the maintenance plan turns that into planned activities with dates, copying each reference activity's resource requirements. Released planned activities are transferred to service orders, which are then run as usual."
      }
    ],
